invalid type: string "Question: How is motor insurance premium calculated?\nAnswer: Premium depends on vehicle type and value, engine capacity, vehicle age, location (metro vs non-metro), NCB discount, voluntary deductible, selected add-ons, and whether the vehicle has anti-theft devices. Higher-value newer vehicles in metro cities with more add-ons will have higher premiums.", expected f64ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ